# Saha Plus Work Log

## Project

- Next.js 14 app in `src/app`.
- Start locally with `npm run dev`.

## Completed

### Login screen and interactive plus field

- Replaced the default Next.js starter page with a responsive Saha Plus sign-in screen.
- Added a green welcome panel filled with drifting plus signs.
- Plus signs respond to pointer movement, and pointer presses create a spreading ripple.
- Added reduced-motion handling and a compact mobile layout.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### Plus field refinement

- Increased the field to 260 independently positioned plus signs.
- Added varied, continuous floating paths so the signs drift rather than sit on a grid.
- Plus signs grow as the pointer approaches and shift in response to pointer movement; pointer-down ripple remains.
- Kept the existing login layout and styling intact for this refinement.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### Reference-matched particle field

- Matched the supplied recording's dense, evenly spaced particle field using 1,444 plus signs.
- Changed the welcome panel from green to deep blue.
- Plus signs softly blink and grow, brighten, and shift around the pointer.
- Kept the existing login layout and copy intact.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### Particle performance and green palette

- Replaced 1,444 animated DOM nodes and pointer-driven React updates with a single canvas renderer.
- Capped rendering at roughly 30 FPS and device pixel ratio 1.5; pauses drawing while the tab is hidden.
- Preserved blinking and cursor-driven growth, brightness, and displacement.
- Changed the decorative panel and accents to a restrained green palette and simplified its background treatment.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### Login form visual polish

- Refined form typography, spacing, input surfaces, and the primary action's hover and pressed states.
- Added explicit keyboard focus-visible styling and clearer link contrast.
- Left the green plus-sign panel, canvas, and animation unchanged.
- Files changed: `src/app/globals.css`.

### Wellness-focused login redesign

- Reworked the login-side welcome message and form hierarchy with warm sage surfaces and more distinctive wellness details.
- Added a compact privacy reassurance and refined the action area.
- Kept the green plus-sign panel, canvas, and animation unchanged.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### In-place registration transition

- Added a registration form that replaces sign-in without navigating to a new page.
- Sign-in and registration forms crossfade in the same form area; the welcome/plus panel glides across with a brief damped sway, then settles.
- Added the reverse transition back to sign-in and reduced-motion handling.
- Preserved the plus canvas drawing implementation and symbol style.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

### Transition motion adjustment

- Kept the welcome panel stable in shape while it slides with a subtle blur.
- Moved the brief damped shake to the plus-sign canvas layer; it settles back to its resting position.
- Kept the plus rendering and styling unchanged.
- Files changed: `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`.

